{
    "word": "airspace",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "95ceb8dd-47ee-3623-b976-4b3402880096",
                "word": "airspace",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "062ea186-36ee-4dce-8967-60d90442b3fe",
                        "entry_id": "95ceb8dd-47ee-3623-b976-4b3402880096",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "airspaces"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0764104f-3d15-3691-9018-b77d38616a78",
                        "entry_id": "95ceb8dd-47ee-3623-b976-4b3402880096",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A specified portion of the atmosphere, especially that under the technical aviation control and/or jurisdiction of a particular state over which territory (and territorial waters) it lies."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "53c3bd3f-b722-4853-8328-e319290f5364",
                                "sense_id": "0764104f-3d15-3691-9018-b77d38616a78",
                                "text": "Holonym: aerospace (not synonymous)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aef0b02b-da29-43fe-b849-7ea9defcf109",
                                "sense_id": "0764104f-3d15-3691-9018-b77d38616a78",
                                "text": "Various European countries transferred the aviation control of their adjoining airspace to Eurocontrol, while each retaining legal jurisdiction."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "901e1cfc-ab8b-4fdd-9619-bf02b64c041d",
                                "sense_id": "0764104f-3d15-3691-9018-b77d38616a78",
                                "text": "Haines has previous experience of dealing with a hugely disruptive crisis. He said: \"I left the railway in 2008 and went to the Civil Aviation Authority. And within a few months I was in the middle of an Icelandic volcanic storm. Eyafjallajokull closed airspace across northern Europe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af0b31b7-1fe9-48cd-97dd-8e008962be40",
                                "sense_id": "0764104f-3d15-3691-9018-b77d38616a78",
                                "text": "During the war, Israel quickly took control of much of Iran's airspace, and attacked its military infrastructure. Top commanders of the Revolutionary Guard and the army were swiftly killed."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "39fd3762-a7e4-32a6-a817-47c93518ef7a",
                        "entry_id": "95ceb8dd-47ee-3623-b976-4b3402880096",
                        "glosses": [
                            "that part of the sky designated for the sole use of aircraft."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9acc9e37-4a4b-3c4e-a056-e97e0e4cbd33",
                        "entry_id": "95ceb8dd-47ee-3623-b976-4b3402880096",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Space (i.e. a few neighboring frequencies) available for broadcasting within a particular frequency band."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a63ef87-4f32-4aa5-9e04-2d3c0723a060",
                                "sense_id": "9acc9e37-4a4b-3c4e-a056-e97e0e4cbd33",
                                "text": "The legalisation of free radios caused a bitter fight for airspace."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "31c9abcf-7fa3-3b12-9c7b-bbc21ea70458",
                        "entry_id": "95ceb8dd-47ee-3623-b976-4b3402880096",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The portion of an enclosed area which contains air, especially breathable air."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "77bad71e-fcd4-3866-bed3-e3ed5c324a71",
                        "entry_id": "95ceb8dd-47ee-3623-b976-4b3402880096",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The cavity in a cavity wall containing air for insulation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
